title: "Boundary-Damped Wave Equilibrium Propagation"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: "Reference implementation and fixed numerical configurations for the boundary-damped wave equilibrium propagation study. The archive includes relaxation and gradient-validation routines, damping-support and sparse-graph experiments, synthetic and image-model benchmarks, automated tests, and reported numerical results."
